sequenceDiagram
    actor Payer as "Retailer/authorized staff"
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant Pay as "paymentService: Service"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    participant PayOS as "payOS: External System"
    alt Prepaid QR/bank transfer
        Payer->>UI: Request payment after final allocation approval
        UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/payments/orders/{orderId}/payos-checkout
        API->>Pay: Validate approved final amount and payment gate
        Pay->>+PayOS: Create checkout for server amount
        PayOS-->>-Pay: Checkout URL/order code
        Pay-->>UI: Redirect to PayOS
        PayOS->>API: POST /api/v1/payments/payos/webhook
        API->>Pay: Verify signature, order, amount, currency and status
        Pay->>DB: Idempotently confirm full payment in canonical ledger
    else Cash / manual transfer / COD
        Payer->>UI: Provide payment evidence
        UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/payments/orders/{orderId}/collect
        API->>Pay: Validate method, stage and full outstanding amount
        Pay->>DB: Record confirmed payment idempotently
    end
    API-->>-UI: Payment status independent from order status
    Note over Pay,DB: Prepaid must be fully paid before dispatch COD is collected at delivery deferred due date starts after complete receipt



